      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-23T01:17:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not sure if this subject has been brought up before, but Spiff’s post on NPC’s got me thinking about sidekicks.</p>\n<p>This could be a neat thing to include in an upcoming expansion. I think it could work one of two ways. Either like the nemesis rule, where there would be a bonus to the main hero (or possibly both) if both were in play.  Or the other option would be to restrict it to certain hero cards. Those cards could be marked with the sidekick’s logo indicating that card does additional damage if the sidekick was being played as well.</p>\n<p>What this really comes down to for me is that I think Wraith could really use a Sparrow.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:53.720Z",
